.claude/agents/impeccable-*.md

# Impeccable — artefatos efêmeros (screenshots, sessões, caches).
# config.json, design.json e surfaces/ são versionados de propósito.
.impeccable/config.local.json
.impeccable/build/
.impeccable/live/sessions/
.impeccable/live/inject-journal.json
.impeccable/mocks/
.impeccable/review/
